flowchart TD
  A[Landing page] --> B{Have an account?}
  B -->|No| C[Sign up]
  B -->|Yes| D[Sign in]
  C --> E{18+ and consents?}
  E -->|Under 18| F[Bounced at the door]
  E -->|Missing consents| G[Error: accept terms + privacy]
  E -->|OK| H[Account created]
  D --> H
  H --> I[Account: card status, tokens, profile]
  I --> J[Get your card, verify]
  J --> K{Brutus consent?}
  K -->|No| L[Verify page: consent required]
  K -->|Yes| M[Stripe Identity hosted check]
  M --> N{Verified?}
  N -->|Failed, retryable| J
  N -->|Yes| O[VIP badge + 20 tokens]
  O --> P[Profile setup: 3 photos, name, bio]
  P --> Q[Browse the floor]
  Q --> R{Browse card actions}
  R -->|Message cold| S[Thread: 5 msgs/day cap]
  R -->|Pass| Q
  R -->|Like| T{Mutual pick?}
  T -->|No| Q
  T -->|Yes| U[Its a match]
  U --> V[Chat thread: unlimited]
  V --> W[Report or Block]
  S --> W
  W --> X[Moderation review]
  Q --> Y[Dance Floor - Phase 2]
  Y --> Z[3 tokens entry]
  Z --> AA[Grid: 2-min selection, 10 picks]
  AA --> AB{First mutual click?}
  AB -->|No match| AC[Private token refund]
  AB -->|Match| AD[One-song chat: 3 min]
  AD --> AE{Continue?}
  AE -->|Yes| AF[Match + badge]
  AE -->|Decline| AG[Chat closes, no follow-up]
